# Research experiment data — large, auto-generated, not part of source.
#
# Raw experiment data must live under a host-owned data root outside the Git
# worktree (${K8LABS_RESEARCH_DATA_ROOT:-<repo>/build}/research/...). These rules
# are a backstop for anything written under research/ by mistake.
*.csv
*.json
!**/tests/fixtures/*.json
*.png
*.svg
*.pyc
__pycache__/
linux-sched/experiments/data/
linux-sched/analysis/output/
kube-sched/experiments/data/
kube-sched/analysis/output/
